{"data": {"node": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "7535297866529690", "organization": {"id": "1699695040438803", "viewer_permissions": [], "application_groupings": {"nodes": [{"viewer_has_update_access": false, "full_applications": {"nodes": [{"id": "7535297866529690"}]}, "id": "1601044187386895"}]}}, "firstRevision": {"nodes": [{"application": {"id": "7535297866529690", "release_date": 1712340960, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "scheduled_offers": {"count": 26}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "28928814050084762"}, "id": "338814269131962"}]}}, "binary": null, "live_binary": null, "created_date": 1791308355, "id": "28925813530384814", "is_initial_release": false, "name_with_fallback": "v23", "pdp_metadata_with_fallback": {"version": 17, "application": {"is_concept": false, "latest_released_pdp_metadata": {"id": "28925856310380536"}, "release_status": "RELEASED", "id": "7535297866529690"}, "id": "28925856310380536", "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED"}, "release_date": null, "administration_status": "APPROVED", "is_first": false, "release_status": "RELEASED", "release_type": "SCHEDULED", "pdp_metadata": {"application": {"default_locale": "en_US", "id": "7535297866529690", "is_first_party": false, "enables_in_app_ads": false, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF"}, "iarc_cert": {"id": "3814987888718845"}, "iarc_email": null, "msrp": null, "translations": {"nodes": [{"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "4583890655217869", "locale": "de_DE", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Speed One - Real Racing", "keywords": ["Cars", "Racing", "Simulator", "Driver", "GTA"], "long_description": "# Speed One - Real Racing: VR-Rennen auf Meta Quest\nArcade-Autorennen f\u00fcr **Meta Quest 3S, 3, Pro und 2**. Erkunde eine gro\u00dfe offene Stadt, meistere ihre Missionen und tritt dann auf der Strecke an.\n## Inhalt\n- **Gro\u00dfe offene Stadt** mit mehreren Missionen\n- **6 Rennstrecken**\n- **5 Autos**: W\u00e4hle dein Auto und seine Lackfarbe in der Garage\n## Fahr, wie du willst\n- Cockpit aus der **Ego-Perspektive** oder Verfolgerkamera in der **dritten Person**\n- Lenke mit dem **virtuellen Lenkrad** oder dem **Stick**\n- **Nitro**, um Rivalen auf Geraden zu \u00fcberholen\n- **Handbremse** per Knopf, um durch enge Kurven zu driften\n- Turbo-Auspuff- und Reifenquietsch-Effekte sowie dynamische Kameras\n## Allein oder gegen andere\n- **Einzelspieler und Mehrspieler**\n- K\u00e4mpfe gegen KI-Gegner ums Podium, mit Live-Positionen im HUD\n## Gut zu wissen\n- Sitzend mit Meta-Quest-Controllern oder Gamepad spielbar\n- Kein Internet f\u00fcr Einzelspieler n\u00f6tig\n- 1,47 GB Installation\n- **Komfortstufe: Intensiv.** Schnelle Bewegungen; ideal f\u00fcr Spieler, die Geschwindigkeit in VR gewohnt sind. F\u00fcr das Spielen im Sitzen gedacht.\n## W\u00e4chst weiter\nSpeed One bekommt laufend Updates, und Spielerbewertungen bestimmen, was als N\u00e4chstes kommt. Sag uns, welche Autos und Strecken du sehen willst!", "short_description": "Erkunde eine gro\u00dfe offene Stadt mit mehreren Missionen und fahre 6 Strecken in 5 Autos. Speed One - Real Racing ist Arcade-VR-Rennen f\u00fcr Meta Quest 3S, 3, Pro und 2: fahre in der 1. oder 3. Person, mit virtuellem Lenkrad oder Stick, nutze Nitro und ziehe die Handbremse in enge Kurven. Einzelspieler und Mehrspieler. Sitzend mit Controllern oder Gamepad. Kein Internet f\u00fcr Einzelspieler n\u00f6tig."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "2406121090129148", "locale": "pt_BR", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Speed One - Real Racing", "keywords": ["Racing", "Drift", "Carros", "Simulador", "Corrida"], "long_description": "# Speed One - Real Racing: corrida em VR no Meta Quest\nCorrida de carros arcade feita para **Meta Quest 3S, 3, Pro e 2**. Explore uma grande cidade aberta, encare suas miss\u00f5es e depois leve a disputa para a pista.\n## O que tem no jogo\n- **Grande cidade aberta** com v\u00e1rias miss\u00f5es\n- **6 pistas de corrida**\n- **5 carros**: escolha seu carro e a cor da pintura na garagem\n## Dirija do seu jeito\n- Cockpit em **primeira pessoa** ou c\u00e2mera de persegui\u00e7\u00e3o em **terceira pessoa**\n- Dirija com o **volante virtual** ou o **stick**\n- **Nitro** para passar os rivais nas retas\n- **Freio de m\u00e3o** em um bot\u00e3o para jogar o carro nas curvas fechadas\n- Efeitos de escapamento turbo e derrapagem dos pneus, al\u00e9m de c\u00e2meras din\u00e2micas que acompanham a a\u00e7\u00e3o\n## Corra sozinho ou contra outros\n- **Single player e multiplayer**\n- Enfrente rivais de IA pelo p\u00f3dio, com posi\u00e7\u00f5es ao vivo no seu HUD\n## Bom saber\n- Jogue sentado com controles do Meta Quest ou um gamepad\n- N\u00e3o precisa de internet no single player\n- Instala\u00e7\u00e3o de 1,47 GB\n- **Classifica\u00e7\u00e3o de conforto: Intenso.** Movimento r\u00e1pido; ideal para quem j\u00e1 est\u00e1 acostumado com velocidade em VR. Feito para jogar sentado.\n## Sempre evoluindo\nSpeed One recebe atualiza\u00e7\u00f5es constantes, e as avalia\u00e7\u00f5es dos jogadores definem o que vem a seguir. Conte para n\u00f3s quais carros e pistas voc\u00ea quer ver!", "short_description": "Explore uma cidade aberta com v\u00e1rias miss\u00f5es e dispute 6 pistas em 5 carros. Speed One - Real Racing \u00e9 corrida arcade em VR para Meta Quest 3S, 3, Pro e 2: dirija em 1\u00aa ou 3\u00aa pessoa, com volante virtual ou stick, use o nitro e puxe o freio de m\u00e3o nas curvas. Solo e multiplayer. Jogue sentado com controles ou gamepad. Sem internet no single player."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1418551027077005", "locale": "ja_JP", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Speed One - Real Racing", "keywords": ["Cars", "Racing", "Drift", "Fun", "Velocity"], "long_description": "# Speed One - Real Racing\uff1aMeta Quest\u306eVR\u30ec\u30fc\u30b7\u30f3\u30b0\n**Meta Quest 3S\u30fb3\u30fbPro\u30fb2**\u5411\u3051\u306e\u30a2\u30fc\u30b1\u30fc\u30c9\u30ab\u30fc\u30ec\u30fc\u30b9\u3002\u5927\u304d\u306a\u30aa\u30fc\u30d7\u30f3\u30b7\u30c6\u30a3\u3092\u63a2\u7d22\u3057\u3066\u30df\u30c3\u30b7\u30e7\u30f3\u306b\u6311\u307f\u3001\u30b5\u30fc\u30ad\u30c3\u30c8\u3067\u52dd\u8ca0\u3057\u3088\u3046\u3002\n## \u53ce\u9332\u5185\u5bb9\n- \u8907\u6570\u306e\u30df\u30c3\u30b7\u30e7\u30f3\u304c\u3042\u308b**\u5927\u304d\u306a\u30aa\u30fc\u30d7\u30f3\u30b7\u30c6\u30a3**\n- **6\u3064\u306e\u30ec\u30fc\u30b9\u30b3\u30fc\u30b9**\n- **5\u53f0\u306e\u30af\u30eb\u30de**\uff1a\u30ac\u30ec\u30fc\u30b8\u3067\u8eca\u7a2e\u3068\u30dc\u30c7\u30a3\u30ab\u30e9\u30fc\u3092\u9078\u629e\n## \u597d\u304d\u306a\u30b9\u30bf\u30a4\u30eb\u3067\u904b\u8ee2\n- **1\u4eba\u79f0**\u306e\u30b3\u30c3\u30af\u30d4\u30c3\u30c8\u8996\u70b9\u307e\u305f\u306f**3\u4eba\u79f0**\u306e\u8ffd\u5f93\u8996\u70b9\n- **\u30d0\u30fc\u30c1\u30e3\u30eb\u30cf\u30f3\u30c9\u30eb**\u307e\u305f\u306f**\u30b9\u30c6\u30a3\u30c3\u30af**\u3067\u64cd\u4f5c\n- **\u30cb\u30c8\u30ed**\u3067\u76f4\u7dda\u3067\u30e9\u30a4\u30d0\u30eb\u3092\u629c\u304d\u53bb\u308b\n- \u30dc\u30bf\u30f3\u3072\u3068\u3064\u306e**\u30cf\u30f3\u30c9\u30d6\u30ec\u30fc\u30ad**\u3067\u30bf\u30a4\u30c8\u306a\u30b3\u30fc\u30ca\u30fc\u3092\u653b\u7565\n- \u30bf\u30fc\u30dc\u6392\u6c17\u97f3\u3084\u30bf\u30a4\u30e4\u30b9\u30ad\u30c3\u30c9\u306e\u30a8\u30d5\u30a7\u30af\u30c8\u3001\u30a2\u30af\u30b7\u30e7\u30f3\u3092\u8ffd\u3046\u30c0\u30a4\u30ca\u30df\u30c3\u30af\u30ab\u30e1\u30e9\n## \u30bd\u30ed\u3067\u3082\u5bfe\u6226\u3067\u3082\n- **\u30b7\u30f3\u30b0\u30eb\u30d7\u30ec\u30a4\u3068\u30de\u30eb\u30c1\u30d7\u30ec\u30a4**\n- AI\u30e9\u30a4\u30d0\u30eb\u3068\u8868\u5f70\u53f0\u3092\u4e89\u3044\u3001HUD\u3067\u30ea\u30a2\u30eb\u30bf\u30a4\u30e0\u306e\u9806\u4f4d\u3092\u78ba\u8a8d\n## \u77e5\u3063\u3066\u304a\u304d\u305f\u3044\u3053\u3068\n- Meta Quest\u30b3\u30f3\u30c8\u30ed\u30fc\u30e9\u30fc\u307e\u305f\u306f\u30b2\u30fc\u30e0\u30d1\u30c3\u30c9\u3067\u5ea7\u3063\u3066\u30d7\u30ec\u30a4\n- \u30b7\u30f3\u30b0\u30eb\u30d7\u30ec\u30a4\u306f\u30a4\u30f3\u30bf\u30fc\u30cd\u30c3\u30c8\u4e0d\u8981\n- \u30a4\u30f3\u30b9\u30c8\u30fc\u30eb\u5bb9\u91cf 1.47 GB\n- **\u5feb\u9069\u5ea6\uff1aIntense\uff08\u5f37\uff09\u3002** \u9ad8\u901f\u306a\u52d5\u304d\u304c\u3042\u308a\u307e\u3059\u3002VR\u3067\u306e\u30b9\u30d4\u30fc\u30c9\u306b\u6163\u308c\u305f\u30d7\u30ec\u30a4\u30e4\u30fc\u5411\u3051\u3002\u5ea7\u3063\u3066\u30d7\u30ec\u30a4\u3059\u308b\u8a2d\u8a08\u3067\u3059\u3002\n## \u9032\u5316\u3057\u7d9a\u3051\u307e\u3059\nSpeed One\u306f\u7d99\u7d9a\u7684\u306b\u30a2\u30c3\u30d7\u30c7\u30fc\u30c8\u3055\u308c\u3001\u30d7\u30ec\u30a4\u30e4\u30fc\u306e\u30ec\u30d3\u30e5\u30fc\u304c\u4eca\u5f8c\u306e\u5185\u5bb9\u3092\u6c7a\u3081\u307e\u3059\u3002\u898b\u305f\u3044\u30af\u30eb\u30de\u3084\u30b3\u30fc\u30b9\u3092\u6559\u3048\u3066\u304f\u3060\u3055\u3044\uff01", "short_description": "\u5927\u304d\u306a\u30aa\u30fc\u30d7\u30f3\u30b7\u30c6\u30a3\u3067\u30df\u30c3\u30b7\u30e7\u30f3\u306b\u6311\u307f\u30015\u53f0\u306e\u30af\u30eb\u30de\u30676\u30b3\u30fc\u30b9\u3092\u30ec\u30fc\u30b9\u3002Speed One - Real Racing\u306fMeta Quest 3S\u30fb3\u30fbPro\u30fb2\u5411\u3051\u306e\u30a2\u30fc\u30b1\u30fc\u30c9VR\u30ec\u30fc\u30b7\u30f3\u30b0\u30021\u4eba\u79f0/3\u4eba\u79f0\u3001\u30d0\u30fc\u30c1\u30e3\u30eb\u30cf\u30f3\u30c9\u30eb\u307e\u305f\u306f\u30b9\u30c6\u30a3\u30c3\u30af\u3001\u30cb\u30c8\u30ed\u3068\u30cf\u30f3\u30c9\u30d6\u30ec\u30fc\u30ad\u3067\u30b3\u30fc\u30ca\u30fc\u653b\u7565\u3002\u30b7\u30f3\u30b0\u30eb\u3068\u30de\u30eb\u30c1\u30d7\u30ec\u30a4\u5bfe\u5fdc\u3002\u5ea7\u3063\u305f\u307e\u307e\u30b3\u30f3\u30c8\u30ed\u30fc\u30e9\u30fc\u307e\u305f\u306f\u30b2\u30fc\u30e0\u30d1\u30c3\u30c9\u3067\u30d7\u30ec\u30a4\u3002\u30b7\u30f3\u30b0\u30eb\u306f\u30a4\u30f3\u30bf\u30fc\u30cd\u30c3\u3