: "450511384091966", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974575_450511387425299_8054204985770043626_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=p9RtwcweoQMQ7kNvwEXsDde&_nc_oc=AdqxdhvtMycJJWtZFhYCKlcYIgdYub6GZz0xewjg5D9En12lnOc9JYuTRR7ElGbBXMg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQP_MJqAMtLUsgCXpu9MDPFXVawTWg0gsdVUvvx_XqzY6w&oe=6ACCE018"}, {"file_name": "SQUARE - 1440X1440 novo.png", "id": "419507087435560", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57569452_419507090768893_8754020340433140475_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=--aOFmGurOsQ7kNvwEyGdWg&_nc_oc=AdoNeaVFOVC7xgB8MoaHUMK2IPnw7K3X0uWCwe6jkD-lF4QKBpbbu843VRQBzyuzekU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOwtLyINFDJsdiyQX_UOkTBILGxyftibNtZkrOMWlg6sg&oe=6ACCE186"}]}, "id": "1128175439714444", "locale": "en_US", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "Screenshots 2560 x 1440px 1.png", "id": "1747029335823117", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/43931330_1747029339156450_4102539444759766374_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-hUh1X40dvEQ7kNvwF5JoNq&_nc_oc=AdoBzVL6uIC6iRpeB3yRhrgtAN-28RarxbZjv2UNshxrYAgeKR8AHNd_ngqBmPX0kzE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOk22SEBnp-YUZ_jbnVAUDFd54zoIF5j-hzSTK6EctavA&oe=6ACD0421"}, {"file_name": "Screenshots 2560 x 1440px 5.png", "id": "1556480058531622", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982500_1556480061864955_8088281580031592040_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=y7Zi5m3vTUoQ7kNvwGvC6Bb&_nc_oc=Ado2kEhQoTw07rJWmycrWlJL9AVWqtZMhu09cRuEJUFJ0yiRfpXpm-lPZL119irODg4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNDpxnUffI9ad8gCY2YccxzC_91HrkTZ8N78fbTEdBI6A&oe=6ACCFEA7"}, {"file_name": "Screenshots 2560 x 1440px 2.png", "id": "1117606969382087", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974544_1117606972715420_7641892375241908929_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Pw9DrG193ZkQ7kNvwF30IXl&_nc_oc=AdrLYXC0mhLCu89X_m8UhvKRvLsryfIQivxAuQ0Yr8LDzfiEJTPJLnSk5l2BrPayrp4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQONWE5F5nxgxpDwPc214L0Ygc9qfOmjQQul8hCy2xhcig&oe=6ACCEADC"}, {"file_name": "Speed One 20042025 2.png", "id": "1062431899163175", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/507892326_1062431902496508_7109177214321849315_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JxUuADwEGBcQ7kNvwHFbuiW&_nc_oc=AdqUaIt450nMc-lZk8YAwM73aWk0cHbmxwR-Lw8Iq8USY6a_s83_h9juL6QUfRHPF_8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQO19Ep6Levo0VQHQbn0i7r_Zry_a-66lNK5KUaUa201dA&oe=6ACCF5D5"}, {"file_name": "Screenshots 2560 x 1440px 3.png", "id": "1351642872594000", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819934_1351642875927333_9199714901783134749_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Qm8otM0TMgkQ7kNvwFfsaPL&_nc_oc=AdqBistzCv3y-T3emjiLtMc6IvWLEtfsoub4BR7MuFUoRlnyG56JTZ2vdxH04Fu_cig&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMrn-SGbCnO1b9DnHYMtBZfkneogIMxPpzWESdt7bm8_g&oe=6ACD0EBB"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "2560x1440 Landscape Speed One.png", "id": "391698880598317", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982451_391698883931650_7054955259597957390_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DeFuEip3mGYQ7kNvwFzDxQC&_nc_oc=AdpqW66ucU5VSbuGdSVyLEuKEJ2UXTdQHTLzED3T9wg_08POs1pS7HJ-LcSUlPTTC74&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQM96fap45Z8nQl--SSjDQtLC_UmPRZNI6lZi_aFCctNYQ&oe=6ACCF54E"}, "display_name": "Speed One - Real Racing", "keywords": ["racing", "cars", "driving", "arcade", "multiplayer"], "long_description": "# Speed One - Real Racing: VR Racing on Meta Quest\n\nArcade car racing built for **Meta Quest 3S, 3, Pro and 2**. Explore a big open city, take on its missions, then take the fight to the track.\n\n## What's Inside\n- **Big open city** with several missions\n- **6 race tracks**\n- **5 cars**: pick your ride and its paint color in the garage\n\n## Drive Your Way\n- **First-person** cockpit or **third-person** chase view\n- Steer with the **virtual steering wheel** or the **thumbstick**\n- **Nitro** to blast past rivals on the straights\n- **Handbrake** on a button to whip the car through tight corners\n- Turbo exhaust and tire-skid effects, plus dynamic cameras that follow the action\n\n## Race Solo or Against Others\n- **Single player and multiplayer**\n- Battle AI rivals for the podium, with live race positions on your HUD\n\n## Good to Know\n- Seated play with Meta Quest controllers or a gamepad\n- No internet required for single player\n- 1.47 GB install\n- **Comfort rating: Intense.** Expect fast motion; best for players already comfortable with speed in VR. Designed to be played seated.\n\n## Still Growing\nSpeed One keeps getting updates, and player reviews shape what comes next. Tell us which cars and tracks you want to see!", "short_description": "Explore a big open city with several missions, then race 6 tracks in 5 cars. Speed One - Real Racing is arcade VR racing for Meta Quest 3S, 3, Pro and 2: drive in 1st or 3rd person, steer with the virtual wheel or the thumbstick, fire the nitro and pull the handbrake into tight corners. Single player and multiplayer. Play seated with controllers or a gamepad. No internet required for single player."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1118380837438919", "locale": "ko_KR", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Speed One - Real Racing", "keywords": [], "long_description": "# Speed One - Real Racing: Meta Quest VR \ub808\uc774\uc2f1\n**Meta Quest 3S, 3, Pro, 2**\ub97c \uc704\ud574 \ub9cc\ub4e0 \uc544\ucf00\uc774\ub4dc \uc790\ub3d9\ucc28 \ub808\uc774\uc2f1. \ub113\uc740 \uc624\ud508 \uc2dc\ud2f0\ub97c \ud0d0\ud5d8\ud558\uace0 \ubbf8\uc158\uc5d0 \ub3c4\uc804\ud55c \ub4a4 \ud2b8\ub799\uc5d0\uc11c \uc2b9\ubd80\ud558\uc138\uc694.\n## \uad6c\uc131\n- \uc5ec\ub7ec \ubbf8\uc158\uc774 \uc788\ub294 **\ub113\uc740 \uc624\ud508 \uc2dc\ud2f0**\n- **6\uac1c \ub808\uc774\uc2a4 \ud2b8\ub799**\n- **5\ub300\uc758 \uc790\ub3d9\ucc28**: \ucc28\uace0\uc5d0\uc11c \ucc28\ub7c9\uacfc \ub3c4\uc0c9 \uc0c9\uc0c1 \uc120\ud0dd\n## \uc6d0\ud558\ub294 \ubc29\uc2dd\uc73c\ub85c \uc6b4\uc804\n- **1\uc778\uce6d** \ucf55\ud54f \ub610\ub294 **3\uc778\uce6d** \ucd94\uaca9 \uc2dc\uc810\n- **\uac00\uc0c1 \uc2a4\ud2f0\uc5b4\ub9c1 \ud720** \ub610\ub294 **\uc378\uc2a4\ud2f1**\uc73c\ub85c \uc870\ud5a5\n- \uc9c1\uc120 \uad6c\uac04\uc5d0\uc11c \ub77c\uc774\ubc8c\uc744 \ucd94\uc6d4\ud558\ub294 **\ub2c8\ud2b8\ub85c**\n- \ubc84\ud2bc \ud558\ub098\ub85c \uae09\ucee4\ube0c\ub97c \ub3cc\ud30c\ud558\ub294 **\ud578\ub4dc\ube0c\ub808\uc774\ud06c**\n- \ud130\ubcf4 \ubc30\uae30 \ubc0f \ud0c0\uc774\uc5b4 \uc2a4\ud0a4\ub4dc \ud6a8\uacfc, \uc561\uc158\uc744 \ub530\ub77c\uac00\ub294 \ub2e4\uc774\ub0b4\ubbf9 \uce74\uba54\ub77c\n## \ud63c\uc790 \ub610\ub294 \ud568\uaed8\n- **\uc2f1\uae00 \ud50c\ub808\uc774\uc640 \uba40\ud2f0\ud50c\ub808\uc774**\n- AI \ub77c\uc774\ubc8c\uacfc \ud3ec\ub514\uc6c0\uc744 \ub450\uace0 \uacbd\uc7c1, HUD\uc5d0 \uc2e4\uc2dc\uac04 \uc21c\uc704 \ud45c\uc2dc\n## \uc54c\uc544\ub450\uc138\uc694\n- Meta Quest \ucee8\ud2b8\ub864\ub7ec \ub610\ub294 \uac8c\uc784\ud328\ub4dc\ub85c \uc549\uc544\uc11c \ud50c\ub808\uc774\n- \uc2f1\uae00 \ud50c\ub808\uc774\ub294 \uc778\ud130\ub137 \ubd88\ud544\uc694\n- \uc124\uce58 \uc6a9\ub7c9 1.47 GB\n- **\ud3b8\uc548\ud568 \ub4f1\uae09: Intense(\uac15\ud568).** \ube60\ub978 \uc6c0\uc9c1\uc784\uc774 \uc788\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4. VR \uc18d\ub3c4\uac10\uc5d0 \uc775\uc219\ud55c \ud50c\ub808\uc774\uc5b4\uc5d0\uac8c \uc801\ud569\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4. \uc549\uc544\uc11c \ud50c\ub808\uc774\ud558\ub3c4\ub85d \uc124\uacc4\ub418\uc5c8\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4.\n## \uacc4\uc18d \uc131\uc7a5 \uc911\nSpeed One\uc740 \uafb8\uc900\ud788 \uc5c5\ub370\uc774\ud2b8\ub418\uba70, \ud50c\ub808\uc774\uc5b4 \ub9ac\ubdf0\uac00 \ub2e4\uc74c \uc5c5\ub370\uc774\ud2b8\ub97c \uacb0\uc815\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4. \ubcf4\uace0 \uc2f6\uc740 \uc790\ub3d9\ucc28\uc640 \ud2b8\ub799\uc744 \uc54c\ub824\uc8fc\uc138\uc694!", "short_description": "\ub113\uc740 \uc624\ud508 \uc2dc\ud2f0\uc5d0\uc11c \uc5ec\ub7ec \ubbf8\uc158\uc744 \uc990\uae30\uace0, 5\ub300\uc758 \ucc28\ub85c 6\uac1c \ud2b8\ub799\uc744 \ub808\uc774\uc2a4\ud558\uc138\uc694. Speed One - Real Racing\uc740 Meta Quest 3S, 3, Pro, 2\uc6a9 \uc544\ucf00\uc774\ub4dc VR \ub808\uc774\uc2f1\uc785\ub2c8\ub2e4. 1\uc778\uce6d/3\uc778\uce6d, \uac00\uc0c1 \uc2a4\ud2f0\uc5b4\ub9c1 \ud720 \ub610\ub294 \uc2a4\ud2f1, \ub2c8\ud2b8\ub85c\uc640 \ud578\ub4dc\ube0c\ub808\uc774\ud06c\ub85c \ucf54\ub108\ub97c \uacf5\ub7b5\ud558\uc138\uc694. \uc2f1\uae00\uacfc \uba40\ud2f0\ud50c\ub808\uc774 \uc9c0\uc6d0. \uc549\uc544\uc11c \ucee8\ud2b8\ub864\ub7ec \ub610\ub294 \uac8c\uc784\ud328\ub4dc\ub85c \ud50c\ub808\uc774. \uc2f1\uae00\uc740 \uc778\ud130\ub137 \ubd88\ud544\uc694."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1113161098296160", "locale": "es_LA", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Speed One - Real Racing", "keywords": [], "long_description": "# Speed One - Real Racing: carreras en VR en Meta Quest\nCarreras de coches arcade creadas para **Meta Quest 3S, 3, Pro y 2**. Explora una gran ciudad abierta, completa sus misiones y luego lleva la batalla a la pista.\n## Qu\u00e9 incluye\n- **Gran ciudad abierta** con varias misiones\n- **6 pistas de carreras**\n- **5 coches**: elige tu coche y su color en el garaje\n## Conduce a tu manera\n- Cabina en **primera persona** o c\u00e1mara de persecuci\u00f3n en **tercera persona**\n- Conduce con el **volante virtual** o el **stick**\n- **Nitro** para adelantar a los rivales en las rectas\n- **Freno de mano** en un bot\u00f3n para tomar las curvas cerradas\n- Efectos de escape turbo y derrapes, adem\u00e1s de c\u00e1maras din\u00e1micas que siguen la acci\u00f3n\n## Corre solo o contra otros\n- **Un jugador y multijugador**\n- Lucha contra rivales de IA por el podio, con posiciones en vivo en tu HUD\n## Para tener en cuenta\n- Juego sentado con mandos de Meta Quest o un gamepad\n- Sin internet en el modo un jugador\n- Instalaci\u00f3n de 1,47 GB\n- **Nivel de comodidad: Intenso.** Movimiento r\u00e1pido; ideal para jugadores acostumbrados a la velocidad en VR. Dise\u00f1ado para jugar sentado.\n## Sigue creciendo\nSpeed One recibe actualizaciones constantes y las rese\u00f1as de los jugadores definen lo que viene. \u00a1Cu\u00e9ntanos qu\u00e9 coches y pistas quieres ver!", "short_description": "Explora una gran ciudad abierta con varias misiones y compite en 6 pistas con 5 coches. Speed One - Real Racing es carreras arcade en VR para Meta Quest 3S, 3, Pro y 2: conduce en 1.\u00aa o 3.\u00aa persona, con volante virtual o stick, usa el nitro y tira del freno de mano en las curvas. Un jugador y multijugador. Juega sentado con mandos o un gamepad. Sin internet en el modo un jugador."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1090929037000216", "locale": "fr_FR", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Speed One - Real Racing", "keywords": ["Cars", "Racing", "Cockpit", "Simulator", "Multiplayer"], "long_description": "# Speed One - Real Racing : course VR sur Meta Quest\nCourse automobile arcade con\u00e7ue pour **Meta Quest 3S, 3, Pro et 2**. Explorez une grande ville ouverte, relevez ses missions, puis passez \u00e0 la piste.\n## Au programme\n- **Grande ville ouverte** avec plusieurs missions\n- **6 circuits**\n- **5 voitures** : choisissez votre bolide et sa couleur au garage\n## Conduisez \u00e0 votre fa\u00e7on\n- Cockpit en **premi\u00e8re personne** ou vue poursuite en **troisi\u00e8me personne**\n- **Volant virtuel** ou **stick**\n- **Nitro** pour doubler vos rivaux en ligne droite\n- **Frein \u00e0 main** sur un bouton pour enrouler les virages serr\u00e9s\n- Effets d'\u00e9chappement turbo et de d\u00e9rapage, plus des cam\u00e9ras dynamiques qui suivent l'action\n## Seul ou contre d'autres\n- **Solo et multijoueur**\n- Affrontez des rivaux IA pour le podium, avec vos positions en direct sur le HUD\n## Bon \u00e0 savoir\n- Jeu assis avec les manettes Meta Quest ou une manette de jeu\n- Pas d'Internet requis en solo\n- Installation de 1,47 Go\n- **Niveau de confort : Intense.** Mouvements rapides ; id\u00e9al pour les joueurs d\u00e9j\u00e0 \u00e0 l'aise avec la vitesse en VR. Con\u00e7u pour jouer assis.\n## Toujours en \u00e9volution\nSpeed One re\u00e7oit des mises \u00e0 jour r\u00e9guli\u00e8res, et les avis des joueurs orientent la suite. Dites-nous quelles voitures et quels circuits vous voulez voir !", "short_description": "Explorez une grande ville ouverte avec plusieurs missions, puis disputez 6 circuits dans 5 voitures. Speed One - Real Racing est une course arcade en VR pour Meta Quest 3S, 3, Pro et 2 : conduisez en 1re ou 3e personne, avec le volant virtuel ou le stick, utilisez le nitro et tirez le frein \u00e0 main dans les virages. Solo et multijoueur. Jouez assis avec les manettes ou une manette de jeu. Pas d'Internet requis en solo."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.animalstriker.com/speedone/privacy_police.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Fabiano Sousa", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.animalstriker.com/speedone/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "673385183287495"}, {"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in